 <h3><u>Bhaiyya sajjad</u></h3> 
 <div style=width:100%> 
  <p></p>
  <p>Haaye,<br> Rukhsat se kuch dayr pehle, akbar ko yaad aayi sughra<br> kehne lage roke akbar, sajjad ke paas jaakar<br> sunlo wasiyat baradar..(2)<br> bhaiyya sajjad..(3)<br> sughra se jaake kehna..(2)<br> <br> 1. Mai aane waala tha sughra..(2)<br> ke nainawaa me nikal aaya aaftab e daham<br> qareeb aake rafeeqo se bole shahe umam<br> yahi mazaar banenge..(2)<br> yahi pe soyenge hum<br> ghareeb e zehra ko ghere huwe hai ehle sitam<br> sughra se jaake kehna<br> mai is liye na aaya..<br> bhaiyya sajjad..(2)<br> sughra se jaake kehna..(2)</p> 
  <p>2. Mai aane waala tha sughra..(2)<br> ke dediya mere baba ne mujhko hukm e azaa'n<br> udhar musalle pe mehwe dua phuphi aur maa<br> kamar hussain ki sadmo..(2)<br> se ho chuki thi kamaa<br> zara si der me laasho'n se saj gaya maidaa'n<br> sughra se jaake kehna..</p> 
  <p>3. Mai aane waala tha sughra..(2)<br> ke yak ba yak meri aankho'n ne dekha ye manzar<br> chale furaat ki janib phuphi ke lakhte jigar<br> chacha ke paas khadi hai..(2)<br> sakina tashna jigar<br> kamar me patka sajaye hai qasime muztarr<br> sughra se jaake kehna...</p> 
  <p>4. Mai aane waala tha sughra..(2)<br> ke maine dekha shahe karbala hai mehwe buka<br> sabab jo rone ka pucha to bole wa waila<br> hussain zulm ke jungle..(2)<br> mein reh gaya tanha<br> mai lut gaya mera ghaazi diler maara gaya<br> sughra se jaake kehna...</p> 
  <p>5. Mai aane waala tha sughra..(2)<br> ke mujhse baba ne aakar kaha ae noore nazar<br> akhi ki laash uthani hai tum chalo lekar<br> chacha ke baad hi chalna..(2)<br> hussain par khanjar<br> mai aise waqt mein aata watan agar khwahar<br> sughra se jaake kehna...</p> 
  <p>6. Mai aane waala tha sughra..(2)<br> ke baade qatl e alamdaar e karbala dekha<br> ghira hai zulm ke narghe me ibne shere khuda<br> tuhi bata ke nibhaata..(2)<br> mai kis tarha waada<br> udhar behen ki mohabbat idhar tha farz mera<br> sughra se jaake kehna...</p> 
  <p>7. Mai aane waala tha sughra..(2)<br> ke mujhse dard ke irfaan ne kaha akbar<br> jafa ke dasht me tu hai rasool ka mazhar<br> tere baghair adhoora..(2)<br> hai naama e mehzar<br> hussain tera bhi laasha uthaenge rokar<br> sughra se jaake kehna</p> 
  <p>mai is liye na aaya<br> bhaiyya sajjad..(2)<br> sughra se jaake kehna..(2)<br> Mai aane waala tha sughra......</p> 
